{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Include Wales in the Union Flag",
        "additional_details": "I would take the most iconic part of the Welsh flag and add it to the Union Flag. I believe this change will make England and Wales closer and help us prosper more for the future. England, Northern Ireland, Scotland and Wales are all proud and beautiful nations but I believe the importance of a united Britain is the best chance we have in the coming future to remain a global power and haven for growth and prosperity.",
        "background": "I would like a new version of the Union Flag to include Wales. As a country I feel we are extremely divided and I believe having a flag to represent us all will bring greater unity as well as greater understanding for the future, everyone equal and everyone heard.",
